[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   Step 137: RTG cross-generator degradation regression (step_b101).
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   The thermal-regression close on the RTG channel named in step 098
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   and bounded by step 103.  Per-sensor thermal telemetry is not
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   publicly archived for the Voyager bus (the JPL thermal-model
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   literature records that the flight system carries very few
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   temperature sensors), so the physically meaningful regression of
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   the RTG decline against the spacecraft's thermal/degradation state
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   is run against the full cross-generator ensemble: every unit-level
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   P/P0 series in the Whiting & Woerner (2023) Dryad dataset, six RTG
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   families, 34 series.
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T1  Ensemble extraction: all unit-level series (MHW, GPHS, MMRTG,
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   SNAP-19, SNAP-27, SNAP-9A).
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T2  Smooth per-unit baselines (quadratic in log P/P0 over mission
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   years) -- a 9-yr excursion cannot distort a 10-40 yr fit.
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T3  Pooled wander null: the empirical distribution of residual
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   change over 9-yr windows across every generator -- what real,
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   documented RTG aging does to a crossing-aligned window.
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T4  Crossing-window test: Voyager per-unit and mission-total
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   residual change over the heliopause-aligned windows (V1
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   34.75-43.75 yr per step_103, opening at its t_hp = 34.97 yr;
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   V2 34.5-43.5 yr, closing just after its t_hp = 41.22 yr --
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   the widest post-crossing window the V2 record supports),
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   priced against the pooled null.
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T5  Sibling-coherence thermal control: units sharing one
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   spacecraft share its thermal/bus environment; the
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   within-mission versus cross-mission residual-difference
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   distribution measures how much common-mode wander the shared
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   thermal state can supply.
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   T6  Bound translation through the Gamow amplification of step 098
[2026-09-21 15:17:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 137]   (|d lambda/lambda| = 152.7 |d alpha_eff/alpha_eff|).
